      "content": "English: Hezekiah | French: Ezékias | Latin: Ezechias | Origin: &#1495;&#1460;&#1494;&#1456;&#1511;&#1460;&#1497;&#1468;&#1464;&#1492; | Vietnamese: Khít-ki-gia 1 -- con vua A-khát, vua Giu-đa, 2 V 18,1",
